        "sentence": 23,
        "en": "For instance, when we observe casually, we may not be aware of factors that bias our observations, and, and when we rarely keep formal records of our observations.",
        "at": "and, and when we",
        "zh": [
          "例如，随意观察时，我们可能意识不到哪些因素使观察结果产生偏差，",
          "而且我们很少正式记录观察结果。"
        ],
        "true_cut_word_anchors": [
          {
            "at": "and, and when we",
            "char": 99,
            "actual_first_word": "and",
            "actual_first_word_window": [
              150.83,
              150.91
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "sentence": 25,
        "en": "Observations in research on the other hand are made under precisely defined conditions, that is, in a systematic and objective manner, and with careful record keeping.",
        "at": "that is, in a",
        "zh": [
          "而研究中的观察是在明确规定的条件下开展的，",
          "也就是说，要采用系统、客观的方式，并认真做好记录。"
        ],
        "true_cut_word_anchors": [
          {
            "at": "that is, in a",
            "char": 88,
            "actual_first_word": "that",
            "actual_first_word_window": [
              167.79,
              167.87
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "sentence": 26,
        "en": "Then how are we going to conduct observations in our research studies, and what do we need to do in order to make a scientific and objective observation?",
        "at": "and what do we",
        "zh": [
          "那么，在研究中应该如何进行观察？",
          "要做到科学、客观，我们又需要做些什么？"
        ],
        "true_cut_word_anchors": [
          {
            "at": "and what do we",
            "char": 71,
            "actual_first_word": "and",
            "actual_first_word_window": [
              179.19,
              179.27
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "sentence": 27,
        "en": "Now, as you remember, the primary goal of observation is to describe behaviour, but it is in reality impossible to observe and describe all of a person’s behaviour.",
        "at": "but it is in",
        "zh": [
          "大家还记得，观察的首要目标是描述行为，",
          "但实际上，我们不可能观察并描述一个人的所有行为。"
        ],
        "true_cut_word_anchors": [
          {
            "at": "but it is in",
            "char": 80,
            "actual_first_word": "but",
            "actual_first_word_window": [
              191.27,
              191.35
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "sentence": 51,
        "en": "By sampling as many different situations as possible researchers can reduce the chance that their observation results will be peculiar to a certain set of circumstances and conditions.",
        "at": "researchers can reduce",
        "zh": [
          "尽可能对多种情境取样，",
          "能够降低观察结果只适用于某组特定情形和条件的可能性。"
        ],
        "true_cut_word_anchors": [
          {
            "at": "researchers can reduce",
            "char": 53,
            "actual_first_word": "researchers",
            "actual_first_word_window": [
              347.63,
              348.03
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "sentence": 53,
        "en": "For example, children do not always behave the same way with one parent as they do with the other parent, and animals do not behave the same way in zoos as they do in the wild.",
        "at": "and animals do not",
        "zh": [
          "例如，孩子面对父母中的一方时，表现不一定与面对另一方时相同；",
          "动物在动物园里的行为，也和在野外不同。"
        ],
        "true_cut_word_anchors": [
          {
            "at": "and animals do not",
            "char": 106,
            "actual_first_word": "and",
            "actual_first_word_window": [
