              447.71
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "sentence": 64,
        "en": "When an observer controls one or more conditions in a natural setting in order to determine their effect on behaviour, this procedure is called field experiment.",
        "at": "this procedure is called",
        "zh": [
          "观察者在自然环境中控制一个或多个条件，以确定这些条件对行为的影响，",
          "这种研究程序就叫实地实验。"
        ],
        "true_cut_word_anchors": [
          {
