            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "sentence": 68,
        "en": "Observation without intervention is also called naturalistic observation because its main purpose is to describe behaviour as it normally occurs, that is, in a natural setting, without any attempt by the observer to intervene.",
        "at": "that is, in a",
        "zh": [
          "无干预观察也叫自然观察，因为它主要用于描述行为自然发生时的样子，",
